  "title": "Florentine Artichoke Dip",
  "description": "Parmesan cheese bubbles on the surface of this rich chafing-dish dipper that gets its tang from marinated artichokes. Three cloves of garlic punch up the flavor of this favorite appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "Stephanie S"
